   "stem_html": "In general, early European copyright systems achieved what results?",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 922452,
     "content_html": "Created monopolies, high prices, censorship, and wealth for the Crown.\n",
     "correctness": "1.0"
    },
    {
     "id": 922451,
     "content_html": "Guaranteed authors’ rights.",
     "correctness": "0.0"
    },
    {
     "id": 922450,
